|| FizzBuzz, with a conditional expression of mixed type. The arms are a
|| string, a string, a string and a number, so the expression is general
|| and each value carries its own type to Write.

for i = 1 to 30 do
   Write[(Rem[i, 15] = 0 -> 'FizzBuzz',
          Rem[i, 5] = 0 -> 'Buzz',
          Rem[i, 3] = 0 -> 'Fizz',
          i), '*n']
